ances or Git PATH issues) are never repeated.\nOptimized SOUL & AGENTS: Reworked your core instruction files (\n\nSOUL.md\n and \n\nAGENTS.md\n) to mandate 100% usage of your installed skills and Windows PowerShell commands.\n🔄 Project & Website Automation\nProject Centralization: All cron and heartbeat tasks are now specifically pointed at D:\\AI_PROJECTS\\projects.\nGH-Pages Deployment: Added a new Cron Job in jobs.json dedicated to searching for dynamic website projects and pushing them to the gh-pages branch for deployment.\nAutomatic Git Sync: Refined the periodic sync to step through every folder in your projects directory, auto-committing and pushing all changes to GitHub every 6 hours.\n🛠️ Integrated Skills\nYour assistant is now programmed to synergize the following skills for every task:\n\nSelf-improving-agent: To analyze and optimize its own performance logs.\nGitflow: To manage code changes professionally in D:\\AI_PROJECTS.\nUI-UX-Pro-Max-Plus: To ensure any visuals or websites it builds are professional-grade.\nSummarize: To handle large context batches (logs, long files) efficiently.\nFind-skills: To proactively expand its own capabilities on ClawHub.\nYour AI environment is now fully automated, self-healing, and ready to dominate your D:\\ projects! 🚀"}],"timestamp":1773442428821}}
