{"type":"message","id":"985d8153","parentId":"bd332a52","timestamp":"2026-03-14T00:22:56.485Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"935920850","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n_Learn about the person you're helping. Update this as you go._\n\n- **Name:** muxd22-alt (primary alias for GitHub projects)\n- **What to call them:** mux / username\n- **Pronouns:** _(optional)_\n- **Timezone:** Asia/Riyadh (GMT+3)\n- **Notes:** \n  - Building market analysis tools and knowledge tracking systems\n  - Main project: Daily brief tracker for YouTube channel @intothecryptoverse\n  - Secondary project: Knowledge gap analyzer with flashcards (gaps repo)\n  - Interested in mimicking/tracking daily briefs that will be remade later since \"Benjamin\" won't do YouTube in the future\n  - Uses Telegram as primary messaging platform\n\n## Context\n\n### Projects & Interests\n- **Market Analysis Tools**: Building dashboards to track and analyze market data\n- **Daily Brief Tracking**: Scraping and organizing content from @intothecryptoverse YouTube channel\n- **Knowledge Gap Detection**: Creating tools that identify missing knowledge based on shared content\n- **Flashcard Systems**: Learning tools built from tracked content\n\n### Current Workstreams\n1. **mimic** (https://github.com/muxd22-alt/mimic)\n   - Daily brief GitHub Pages dashboard\n   - Tracks YouTube channel content and market analysis data\n   - Will be remade with future data when Benjamin stops YouTube content\n\n2. **gaps** (https://github.com/muxd22-alt/gaps)\n   - Knowledge gap analyzer\n   - Flashcard generator from shared knowledge\n   - Identifies missing information based on user-provided context\n\n### Preferences\n- **Telegram**: Primary platform for link sharing and briefs\n- **GitHub Pages**: Preferred deployment method for dashboards\n- **Markdown**: Primary documentation format\n\n---\n\n_The more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference._\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773447776483}}
